{% extends "base.html.j2" %}

{% block title %}Gegner-Report — {{ team_name }} ({{ team }}){% endblock %}

{% block subtitle %}{{ generated_on.isoformat() }} · {{ overall_basis.text }}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="summary-block">
<ul>
{% for sentence in summary_sentences %}
<li>{{ sentence }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
</div>

{% if notices %}
<div class="warning-block">
<ul>
{% for notice in notices %}
<li>{{ notice }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
</div>
{% endif %}

{% set ns = namespace(legend_shown=false) %}
{% for section in sections %}
<h2>{{ section.heading }}</h2>
<p class="section-basis">{{ section.basis_text }}</p>
{% if section.chart_data_uri %}
<div class="chart-block">
<img class="chart-img" src="{{ section.chart_data_uri }}" alt="{{ section.heading }}">
</div>
{% endif %}
{% if section.empty_notice %}
<p class="warning-block">{{ section.empty_notice }}</p>
{% else %}
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
{% for header in section.headers %}
<th>{{ header }}</th>
{% endfor %}
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for row in section.rows %}
<tr>
{% for cell in row.cells %}
<td{% if row.muted %} class="muted-cell"{% endif %}>{{ cell }}</td>
{% endfor %}
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
{% if not ns.legend_shown %}
<p class="section-basis">Grau hinterlegte Zeilen: Stichprobe unter n={{ muted_min_n }} (Muting-Schwellenwert) — angezeigt, nie ausgeblendet.</p>
{% set ns.legend_shown = true %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endblock %}

{% block footnotes %}
<p>
Feldzonen (yardline_50, Distanz zur gegnerischen Torlinie):
{% for label, low, high in field_zones %}
{{ label }} ({{ low }}–{{ high }}){% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}
{% endfor %}.
Score State: „Ausgeglichen" bei einem Score-Differential von ±6 oder weniger (ein Touchdown plus PAT-Wert),
sonst „Führung" bzw. „Rückstand".
Konfidenzintervalle nach Clopper-Pearson.
Formation- und Routen-Auswertungen basieren ausschließlich auf Hudl-Charting-Spielen;
Down/Distance-, Play-Call-, 4th-Down- und PAT-Auswertungen nutzen alle verfügbaren Datenquellen.
</p>
{% endblock %}
